flowchart LR
    D[Annual declaration filed by all officials] --> IGR[IG completeness review]
    IGR --> RA{Random audit selected?}
    RA -->|Yes| AUD[Full audit: ANI and procurement cross-checks]
    RA -->|No| REN[Clearance renewed]
    AUD --> RF{Red flag?}
    RF -->|No| REN
    RF -->|Yes| INV[IG investigation]
    INV --> CON{Violation confirmed?}
    CON -->|No| REN
    CON -->|Yes| ACT[Removal or criminal referral]
    REN -->|Next cycle| D

    classDef step fill:#0f1a2e,stroke:#2b3f63,color:#dce5f5,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef decide fill:#2a2410,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#fbbf24,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef good fill:#0f2a20,stroke:#34d399,color:#a7f3d0,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef bad fill:#2a1016,stroke:#fb7185,color:#fecdd3,stroke-width:1.5px;
    class D,IGR,AUD,INV step
    class RA,RF,CON decide
    class REN good
    class ACT bad
